{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36409","headline":"冬夕江上言事五首 二 · 罗邺","name":"冬夕江上言事五首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"喔喔晨鸡满树霜，喧喧晓渡簇舟航。\n数星昨夜寒炉火，一阵谁家腊瓮香。\n久别羇孤成潦倒，回看书劒更苍黄。\n逢人举止皆言命，至竟谋闲可胜忙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗邺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36409.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36409","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}